1. 

Shell - responsible for running the program using most classes in it

Exception classes - get thrown in case of exceptions in Shell

AsciiArtAlgorithm - responsible for running the algorithm using Image and SubImgCharMatcher. 
Being called from Shell.

KeyboardInput - singleton class responsible for getting inout from user in Shell.

SubImgCharMatcher - responsible for matching a subiamge to its brightness value. Used by Shell.

CharConverter - responsible for converting a char into a bright blocks and dark blocks. 
Bring used bySubImgCharMatcher.

Image - this class represent an image. Being used by Shell, ImageConverter and more.

ImageConverter - this singleton class converts an image into sub images with brightness value.
 Being used by Shell.

AsciiOutput - interface for types of rendering ascii output

ConsoleAsciiOutput - type of AsciiOutput. input is being rendered through console.

HtmlAsciiOutput - type of AsciiOutput. input is being rendered through html.

RoundingMethod - enum for rounding method types


‪.‬2

Shell - I've decided to use TreeSet in order to store current chars
 in use so I can print them quickly
in ascending order and also get access to each one in log(n).
 space complexity of the data structure is O(n) and
 we can't get lower than this (n chars to store).
 
SubImgCharMatcher - I've decided to use two TreeMaps.
 First one stores the brightBlocksNorm for each char in the class,
 the bright norm for each char is final,
 because it depends on the bright blocks of each char independently,
 regardless of other blocks bright norm.
 In that way when I remove/add a char I just need to check if it is a max or min norm
 and then update the class in accordance.
 The Second TreeSet is to store the norm of each character.
 in that case I don't need to recompute the norm of each char 
if the user doesn't add/remove chars between sets.
 Also, if maxBrightNorm and minBrightNorm stay the same,
 I don't need to change all the tree set.

‪.‬3
I've used the exception system in order to handle user mistakes and program limitations.
 Run method in Shell class many functions, each function throws an exception with an
 informative message for why exception happened.
 If run catch an exception, the user gets notified.
 In that way I make the code cleaner and also handle the error smarter.

‪.‬4
I've included a method called setRoundingMethod in order to change the rounding method of the class.
 I didn't find an easier way without breaking the API to change the rounding during runtime
, because the rounding is happening inside the class.

      


 